  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://www.cipet.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Central Institute of Petrochemicals Engineering &amp; Technology (CIPET)</a> <span style=\"color: #000000;\">has released the admit card for the Diploma / Post Diploma &amp; PG Diploma Courses Admission 2025 for which the online application process has started from 07 February 2025. Any candidate who is interested to fill this form, they should check eligibility, age limit &amp; must read the Full Notification Before applying for the CIPET Admit Card 2025. Those Candidates Are Interested in the following recruitment can apply online from the link given below.</span></span></span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Central Institute of Petrochemicals Engineering &amp; Technology (CIPET)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">CIPET Admit Card 2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>07 February 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>29 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>29 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffff00;\">Exam Date : 08 June 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available :&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>04 June 2025</strong></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General, OBC : <strong>Rs. 100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST : <strong>Rs. </strong><b>100</b>/-</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>CIPET Admissions 2025 : Age Limit</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No Age Limit For Any Candidates</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>CIPET Admissions 2025 : Course Details</strong></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.0307%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.9693%; text-align: center;\"><strong>CIPET Course Details</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.0307%; text-align: center;\">Class 10th Matric Exam</td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.9693%; text-align: center;\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>3 years</strong> : Diploma in Plastics Mould Technology DPMT</li>\n<li><strong>3 Years</strong> : Diploma in Plastics Technology DPT</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.0307%; text-align: center;\">Diploma</td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.9693%; text-align: center;\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>1.5 Year</strong> : Post Diploma in Plastics Mould Design with CAD / CAm (PD-PMD with CAD/CAM)</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.0307%; text-align: center;\">Degree</td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.9693%; text-align: center;\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>2 Years</strong> : Post Graduate Diploma in Plastics Processing &amp; Testing (PGD-PPT)</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>CIPET Admissions Online Form 2025 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://www.cipet.gov.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the CIPET before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sarkari Result 2025</a> Notification Here – <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check Now.</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for CIPET Admission Online Form can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>CIPET Application Form 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Entrance Examinations (Online / Offline)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://instagram.com/sarkariexam.com_?igshid=YmMyMTA2M2Y=\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Download Admit Card</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://cipet25.onlineregistrationform.org/CIPET/LoginAction_input.action\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://cipet25.onlineregistrationform.org/CIPET/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Download Information Brochure</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/CIPET_Admissions_2025_Brochure-1-19.pdf\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Join WhatsApp Channel</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Join Telegram Channel</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://t.me/sarkariresulinfo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.cipet.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Important Question</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. When will Apply Online Link will Start for CIPET Admission Sarkari Result Online Form 2025?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>Online applications for this application form have started from 07 February 2025.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is Last Date of CIPET Admission Notification 2025?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The last date to apply online for this application form is 29 May 2025.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is Age Limit For CIPET Admission 2025?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong> The age of the candidates applying for this application form as per CIPET rules, see the post wise age information in the official information.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is Qualification For CIPET Application Form 2025?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>To apply for this application form, the candidate must have 10th pass read the official information completely before applying.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. How to Apply For CIPET Admission Online Form 2025?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong> To apply for this application form, first of all you have to go to the Official Sarkari Result which is <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SarkariExam.com</a> and apply through this recruitment page. Through Sarkari Result Official you can apply for many government jobs.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. How to download the result of CIPET Admission Result 2025?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>All those candidates who had given the exam for this application form can now download their result. To download your result, you can download it by entering registration number / roll number and DOB (Date of Birth). The official download link of the result will be made available in the important links above.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is CIPET Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of CIPET is https://www.cipet.gov.in/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
